["<aside class=\"callout warn\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Study aid only. The official regulations are the law.</p></aside><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Steps 1 to 3</th><th>Steps 4 to 6</th><th>Steps 7 to 9</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Paper, clock, season</td><td>Target, road, buildings</td><td>Land, backstop, shot</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>All 9 must be yes. One no, or one \"not sure\": do not shoot.</li></ul><aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>You get about 3 seconds. The 9 questions must be a habit before the animal shows up.</p></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to use the 9 steps</summary><ul><li>Same 9 steps as the \"Is it legal to shoot?\" card in the Field tab.</li><li>Every answer must be <strong>yes</strong>. One no, or one \"not sure\", and you do not shoot.</li><li>Practise saying them in order on every walk until they are automatic.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 790\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"790\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Is it legal to shoot?</text>\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z\" fill=\"#23261f\"/></marker>\n    <marker id=\"ahr\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/></marker>\n  </defs>\n  <!-- red stop column -->\n  <rect x=\"312\" y=\"48\" width=\"80\" height=\"618\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#c92a2a\"/>\n  <text transform=\"translate(360 357) rotate(-90)\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DO NOT SHOOT</text>\n  <!-- question boxes: y = 48 + i*70, height 44 -->\n  <g font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"48\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">1. Licences on me?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"118\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">2. Legal hours right now?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"188\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">3. Season open, MU, sex?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"258\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">4. 100% sure what it is?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"328\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">5. Off road, out of vehicle?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"398\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">6. Over 100 m from buildings?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"468\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">7. Allowed on this land?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"538\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">8. Safe backstop?</text>\n    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"608\" width=\"252\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e9eedd\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <text x=\"134\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#23261f\">9. Clean shot, in my range?</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- yes arrows down -->\n  <g stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\">\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"116\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"186\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"256\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"302\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"326\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"372\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"396\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"442\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"466\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"512\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"536\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"582\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"606\"/>\n    <line x1=\"134\" y1=\"652\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"690\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"180\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"320\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"390\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"460\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"530\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"600\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n    <text x=\"142\" y=\"676\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Yes</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- no arrows right -->\n  <g stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" marker-end=\"url(#ahr)\">\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"70\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"140\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"210\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"280\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"350\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"420\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"420\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"490\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"490\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"560\"/>\n    <line x1=\"260\" y1=\"630\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"630\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"63\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"133\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"203\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"273\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"343\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"413\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"483\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"553\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"623\" fill=\"#c92a2a\">No</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- final -->\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"692\" width=\"384\" height=\"86\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"726\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">All 9 yes: you may shoot</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"756\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Any doubt at any step means no.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Yes goes down. No goes right, to DO NOT SHOOT.</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: the sun rises. Two hours before sunrise, nothing is legal. At 1 hour before sunrise, deer and grouse are legal, ducks and geese must wait. At 30 minutes before sunrise, ducks and geese are legal too. Then sunrise. In the evening deer end 1 hour after sunset and ducks end 30 minutes after sunset.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\" fill=\"#1f2a3a\"><animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#1f2a3a;#5a6f8f;#a9c4de\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></rect>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"230\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#e8590c\"><animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"230;190;172\" keyTimes=\"0;0.85;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></circle>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"190\" width=\"400\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n<path d=\"M0 190 Q 100 170 200 186 T 400 180 L400 196 L0 196 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2 hours before sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1 hour before sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"7s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">30 minutes before sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"7s\" dur=\"0.4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sunrise</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"0s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"70\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer, grouse: wait</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks, geese: wait</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"2s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.3s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"70\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer, grouse: GO</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks, geese: wait</text></g>\n<g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\"0.4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"70\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer, grouse: GO</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"340\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke=\"#5c7a3a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks, geese: GO</text></g>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ducks start 30 minutes later.</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evenings: deer 1 hour after sunset,</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ducks 30 minutes after.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Deer start 1 hour before sunrise. Ducks 30 minutes. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Step 1: Licences on me?</li><li>Step 2: Legal hours right now?</li><li>Step 3: Season open for this animal, here, today?</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each step in full</summary><ol><li><strong>Licences on me?</strong> Photo ID, <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"FWID\">FWID</button> (Fish and Wildlife ID) number, all your species licences for the year (used and unused), and the federal bird permit for ducks <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Legal hours?</strong> Deer and quail: 1 hour before sunrise to 1 hour after sunset <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Ducks: 30 minutes before sunrise to 30 minutes after sunset <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Season open for this species, sex and antler type, in this <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"MU\">MU</button> (Management Unit), today?</strong> Check the synopsis table for your exact MU. Dates: the Rules tab, read from the official synopsis.</li></ol><ul><li>Antler rules like \"4 point\" mean you count points <strong>before</strong> the shot. Tip.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 386\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A 100 metre ring, 109 yards, around an occupied house. A deer inside the ring: no hunting and no shooting. A deer outside the ring: check the other rules. The ring applies to an occupied dwelling, a farm or ranch building with people or domestic animals, a church, a school building or school yard, a playground and a regional district park. Owner permission does not lift it.\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"386\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The 100 m rule</text>\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"36\" width=\"400\" height=\"244\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"158\" r=\"112\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".18\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 7\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(200 160) scale(1.6)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-6\" width=\"36\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-24 -4 L0 -24 L24 -4 Z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"-5\" y=\"6\" width=\"10\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">occupied</text>\n<line x1=\"200\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"304.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><polygon points=\"310,160 301.0,164.3 301.0,155.7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n<text x=\"262\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">100 m (109 yd)</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(130 104) scale(0.9)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -6 L24 -20 L30 -18 L24 -2 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"29\" cy=\"-20\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 8 L-20 26 M-10 8 L-9 26 M12 8 L11 26 M19 6 L21 26\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M-24 -4 l-5 -2\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M26 -24 L22 -36 L16 -42 M22 -36 L28 -44 M30 -24 L34 -36 L30 -44 M34 -36 L40 -42\" stroke=\"#5c3b1c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"82\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140.2\" y1=\"91.8\" x2=\"159.8\" y2=\"72.2\" stroke=\"#c92a2a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<text x=\"118\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#c92a2a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">NO</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(360 250) scale(0.8)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M16 -6 L24 -20 L30 -18 L24 -2 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><ellipse cx=\"29\" cy=\"-20\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><path d=\"M-18 8 L-20 26 M-10 8 L-9 26 M12 8 L11 26 M19 6 L21 26\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M-24 -4 l-5 -2\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M26 -24 L22 -36 L16 -42 M22 -36 L28 -44 M30 -24 L34 -36 L30 -44 M34 -36 L40 -42\" stroke=\"#5c3b1c\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></g>\n<text x=\"352\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">outside</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Counts: an occupied house, a farm or ranch</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"322\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">building with people or animals, a church,</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"342\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">school, school yard, playground, regional</text>\n<text x=\"14\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">district park. Permission does not lift it.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Step 4: 100% sure what it is?</li><li>Step 5: Off the road, out of the vehicle?</li><li>Step 6: Over 100 m (109 yd) from occupied buildings?</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each step in full</summary><ol><li><strong>100% sure what it is?</strong> Species, sex, antler points. For ducks: species before you shoot. Not sure means no. Tip.</li><li><strong>Off the road, out of the vehicle?</strong> No hunting from a motor vehicle, and no hunting from a boat while its motor is pushing it (99%, page 11 items 22 and 23). No shooting across, or hunting on, the road allowance of a numbered highway or a 2 lane public road the province maintains <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. No loaded firearm in or on a vehicle or <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ATV\">ATV</button> (all terrain vehicle) <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Over 100 m (109 yd) from any occupied house, farm or ranch building?</strong> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. This includes your brother's house on the property (95%, my reading).</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 554\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Checklist: can I shoot here? Every one of nine checks must be yes, and a check that does not apply counts as yes. 1 outside every National Park. 2 outside every ecological reserve. 3 not in a BC Park, or its page allows hunting in an open season. 4 over 100 metres (109 yards) from occupied buildings and schools. 5 off the road allowance and not shooting across it. 6 outside No Shooting and No Hunting Areas. 7 on a listed highway, a rifle only past 400 metres from its road allowance. 8 fenced, posted, leased or crop land: the owner said yes. 9 in a town: the local bylaw allows it. Any no: do not shoot. All yes: the place is OK; now check season, licence, target and backstop.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"554\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Need YES to all 9</text>\n<text x=\"380\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#6b5b4b\" text-anchor=\"end\">n/a = yes</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"54\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 74) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-15 11 L-4 -9 L2 1 L6 -4 L15 11z\"/><path d=\"M-4 -9 L-1 -4 L-6 -3z\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Outside National Parks</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 116) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-12 12 C-14 -4 -2 -14 14 -13 C14 4 4 13 -12 12z\"/><path d=\"M-12 12 L6 -6\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Outside ecological reserves</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"138\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 158) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-8 -14 L-1 0 L-4 0 L1 9 L-17 9 L-12 0 L-15 0z\"/><path d=\"M8 -10 L14 1 L12 1 L16 10 L0 10 L4 1 L2 1z\"/><rect x=\"-9.5\" y=\"9\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\"/><rect x=\"6.5\" y=\"10\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">BC Park allows it, in season</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 200) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-14 0 L0 -13 L14 0z\"/><rect x=\"-10\" y=\"0\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\"/><rect x=\"-3\" y=\"5\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Over 100 m from occupied buildings, schools</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"222\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 242) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-6 -14 L-14 14 H14 L6 -14z\"/><path d=\"M0 -12 V-6 M0 -1 V5 M0 9 V14\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Off road allowance, not across it</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 284) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><circle r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M-9 -9 L9 9\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Outside No Shooting, No Hunting Areas</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"306\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 326) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><path d=\"M-12 -13 H12 V2 C12 9 6 13 0 15 C-6 13 -12 9 -12 2z\"/><path d=\"M-6 -6 H6 M-6 0 H6\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Listed highway: rifle past 400 m</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 368) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"-15\" y=\"-10\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"23\"/><rect x=\"11.5\" y=\"-10\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"23\"/><path d=\"M-12 -5 H12 M-12 3 H12 M-12 3 L12 -5\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.6\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Fenced, posted, leased, crop: owner OK</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"390\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f4eedf\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(30 410) scale(0.72)\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke=\"none\"><rect x=\"-15\" y=\"-4\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\"/><rect x=\"-4\" y=\"-14\" width=\"11\" height=\"27\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"0\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\"/><path d=\"M-1 -10 h2 v2 h-2z M3 -10 h2 v2 h-2z M-1 -4 h2 v2 h-2z M3 -4 h2 v2 h-2z M-1 2 h2 v2 h-2z M3 2 h2 v2 h-2z\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/></g>\n<text x=\"54\" y=\"416\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Town: bylaw allows it</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"438\" width=\"384\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(32 458) scale(0.7)\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"none\"><circle r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M-9 -9 L9 9\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/></g>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"465\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">Any NO: DO NOT SHOOT</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"486\" width=\"384\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<path d=\"M22 516 l7 7 l13 -14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fffaf0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"511\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">All yes: the place is OK</text>\n<text x=\"56\" y=\"533\" font-size=\"14.5\" fill=\"#fffaf0\">Now check season, licence, target, backstop</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Step 7: Allowed on this land?</li></ul><ul><li>Step 8: Safe backstop?</li></ul><ul><li>Step 9: Clean shot, inside my tested range?</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each step in full</summary><ol><li><strong>Allowed on this land?</strong> <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Crown land\">Crown land</button> that is open, or owner's permission. Not a park closed to hunting, an ecological reserve or a No Shooting Area <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li><strong>Safe <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Backstop\">Backstop</button>?</strong> Earth behind the animal. No skyline. No people, road, livestock or building beyond. Tip, and your safety course rule.</li><li><strong>Clean shot inside your tested range?</strong> Broadside or quartering away, still animal, steady rest. Tip.</li></ol><ul><li>Steps 8 and 9 are about safety and ethics. They are not optional.</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>When in doubt, don't. The deer will be there next year. A bad shot follows you forever.</p></aside>","<aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Counting antler points after the shot.</li><li>Forgetting that ducks start 30 minutes later than deer in the morning.</li><li>Shooting from the ATV seat \"because the engine is off\".</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Walking in, say the 9 steps out loud once. At the stand, rangefind the nearest building and the road.</p></aside><div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"s12-legal\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:0\"><span>I can say all 9 steps from memory</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:1\"><span>I know today's legal start and end for deer and for ducks</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:2\"><span>I know my MU and today's open seasons</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"s12-legal:3\"><span>I rangefinded the house and the road from my stand</span></label></div>","<ul><li>Every source, page and date checked: tap below.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: every source, page and date checked</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly. Page 4 (an ATV is a motor vehicle), pages 5 and 8 (photo ID, FWID number, carry all species licences), page 7 (federal permit), page 9 (parks, ecological reserves), page 10 (road allowance, 100 m, No Shooting Areas), page 11 items 22, 23, 28, 37 and 38 (no hunting from a vehicle or a motor driven boat, no loaded firearm in or on a vehicle, hours). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bclaws.gov.bc.ca/civix/document/id/complete/statreg/190_84_01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hunting Regulation, B.C. Reg. 190/84</a>, read directly, current to 22 September 2026: s. 14 (hours). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/SOR-2022-105/FullText.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Migratory Birds Regulations, 2022 (SOR/2022-105)</a>, read directly, current to 2026-09-21: s. 28(3)(b) (duck hours south of 60 degrees north; no other BC hours in Schedule 3). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li>Steps 4, 8 and 9 are safety and ethics habits (Tip), not quoted law.</li><li>Full rule detail and certainty: Phase 2 Session 5, BC rules you must know.</li></ul></details>"]